{"Defining downsize a second time in optimized_image.rb overwrites the earlier downsize(from, to, max_width, max_height, opts) method. Callers passing width/height will now bind max_height into opts, breaking option handling and producing wrong dimensions": 0.915245771408081, "Hardcoding maxSizeKB to 10MB removes the configured site setting and makes uploads ignore admin limits, causing a functional regression when sites set different max sizes. Should restore use of Discourse.SiteSettings['max_' + type + '_size_kb']": 0.942850649356842, "Using hardcoded 10MB in uploads_controller.rb ignores SiteSetting.max_image_size_kb, allowing API URL uploads to exceed the configured limit. This is a policy bypass that can lead to larger-than-allowed downloads": 0.9310454726219177}